classDiagram
    direction LR
    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +str frequency
        +date due_date
        +bool completed
        +str task_id
        +__post_init__()
        +mark_complete()
        +next_occurrence(completed_on) Task_or_None
    }
    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +__post_init__()
        +add_task(task)
    }
    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +__post_init__()
        +add_pet(pet)
        +get_pet(name) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() list
    }
    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +schedule_task(pet_name, task)
        +sort_by_time(tasks) list
        +filter_tasks(pet_name, completed, on_date) list
        +get_schedule(pet_name, completed, on_date) list
        +mark_task_complete(task_id, completed_on) Task_or_None
        +detect_conflicts(on_date) list
    }
    Owner "1" *-- "0..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : holds
    Scheduler --> "1" Owner : retrieves pet-task pairs
    Scheduler ..> Task : completes and creates successors
    note for Task "Dataclass. time is validated HH:MM. frequency is once, daily, or weekly. task_id is generated."
    note for Scheduler "Optional filters default to None. All schedule lists contain Pet-Task pairs. Conflicts return warning strings."
